The bedroom is small.
I organize my things.
My big suitcase lies on the bed.
The suitcase is open.
I unpack the clothes.
A wardrobe stands next to the door.
My shirts hang in the wardrobe now.
They hang there very neatly.
My sweaters also lie in the wardrobe.
I take the shoes out of the suitcase.
They have no room in the wardrobe.
But that is no problem.
My shoes stand under the bed now.
They all stand in a row.
I take a step back.
The room looks tidy now.
I smile.
It is very nice.
